      "name": "CMakeLists.txt",
      "filePath": "compat/CMakeLists.txt",
      "summary": "compat 目录的构建脚本，把 selinux_stub.cpp 与 vintf_stub.cpp 分别编译成静态库 selinux_stub / vintf_stub，并把 include/ 作为 PUBLIC 头文件目录暴露出去，用于在宿主机上替换 libselinux 和 libvintf。",
      "tags": ["build-system", "configuration", "cmake", "compat-layer"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:compat/include/aosp_host_compat.h",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "aosp_host_compat.h",
      "filePath": "compat/include/aosp_host_compat.h",
      "summary": "通过 CMake 的 -include 强制注入到每个编译单元的兼容头，预先引入 AOSP 源码在 bionic 下能\"白拿\"、但在 glibc + libstdc++ 下缺失的标准头（C++ 与 C 两套分支）。",
      "tags": ["compat-layer", "header", "glibc-port", "force-include"],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "用强制包含（force include）代替逐处修改源码，使复制过来的 AOSP 源文件与上游保持逐字节一致，便于后续同步升级。"
    },
