    {
      "id": "file:patches/IPCThreadState.patch",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "IPCThreadState.patch",
      "filePath": "patches/IPCThreadState.patch",
      "summary": "针对 AOSP libbinder 的 IPCThreadState.cpp 的补丁，把四处 #if defined(__ANDROID__) 放宽为同时接受 BINDER_ENABLE_KERNEL_IPC，使非 Android 宿主机也能真正执行 BINDER_WRITE_READ 等 ioctl。",
      "tags": ["patch", "aosp-port", "kernel-ipc", "conditional-compilation"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:patches/ProcessState.patch",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "ProcessState.patch",
      "filePath": "patches/ProcessState.patch",
      "summary": "针对 AOSP libbinder 的 ProcessState.cpp 的补丁：新增 kernelHasSelinux() 探测 /sys/fs/selinux，无 SELinux 的内核上跳过 BINDER_SET_CONTEXT_MGR_EXT 改走旧版 ioctl，并放宽驱动打开失败的致命断言条件。",
      "tags": ["patch", "aosp-port", "selinux", "context-manager", "kernel-ipc"],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "关键坑点：在无 SELinux 的内核上 BINDER_SET_CONTEXT_MGR_EXT 这个 ioctl 本身会成功，但之后每次事务都会在驱动内以 \"failed to get security context\" / -EINVAL 失败，因此原有的\"ioctl 出错才回退\"逻辑捕捉不到。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:scripts/run.sh",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "run.sh",
      "filePath": "scripts/run.sh",
      "summary": "一键入口脚本：自动探测可用的 clang 并配置/构建 CMake 工程，若 /dev/binder 缺失则通过 sudo 调用 setup-binder-host.sh 准备驱动，最后 exec binder_demo 运行 demo（支持 servicemanager / service / client 子模式）。",
      "tags": ["entry-point", "build-system", "automation", "shell-script"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "编译器探测不是靠 command -v，而是实打实地编译一个空 main 来验证——因为并存的多版本 clang 可能出现 \"Option registered more than once\" 而根本无法运行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:scripts/setup-binder-host.sh",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "setup-binder-host.sh",
      "filePath": "scripts/setup-binder-host.sh",
      "summary": "需要 root 的一次性宿主机环境准备脚本：加载 binder_linux 模块、把 binderfs 挂到 /dev/binderfs、调用 binderfs_ctl 创建 binder/hwbinder/vndbinder 设备，并做软链与 0666 授权；支持 --teardown 回滚。",
      "tags": ["infrastructure", "shell-script", "kernel-module", "device-setup", "privileged"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "binderfs 创建的节点默认是 root:root 0600，脚本改成 Android 上 /dev/binder 同款的 0666，普通桌面用户（以及 CLion）才能直接打开驱动。设置不跨重启保留。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:tools/binderfs_ctl.cpp",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "binderfs_ctl.cpp",
      "filePath": "tools/binderfs_ctl.cpp",
      "summary": "小工具：在已挂载的 binderfs 上通过 BINDER_CTL_ADD ioctl 逐个创建 binder 设备并打印其 major:minor；设备已存在时只提示而不视为错误。",
      "tags": ["utility", "cli-tool", "ioctl", "binderfs", "infrastructure"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "发行版内核的 CONFIG_ANDROID_BINDER_DEVICES 通常为空，挂载 binderfs 后只有 binder-control 节点，而标准用户态工具并未暴露 BINDER_CTL_ADD，故需要这个自制工具。"
    },
